  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>He</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>, a transition takes place from the orbit of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>105</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>pm</mi></math> to the orbit of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>26</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>pm</mi></math>. The wavelength (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>nm</mi></math> ) of the emitted photon during the transition is</p><p>Bohr radius, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pm</mi></math><br />Rydberg constant, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br />Planck&#39;s constant, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mi>Js</mi></math><br />Speed of light, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> ]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "30",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The radius of the n<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;orbit can be represented as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mfrac><mi>pm</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>105</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>52</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>26</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>&#916;E</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mi>hC</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>hc</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mi>hC</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
